From {{bor|en|sco-smi|bestiall}}, from {{der|en|enm|bestaile}}, from {{der|en|fro|bestaille}}, from {{der|en|LL.|bēstiālia}}; later reinforced and remodelled on {{der|en|frm|bestial}}, itself from {{der|en|LL.|bēstiālis}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|p}}

# {{senseid|en|cattle}} {{lb|en|Scotland|obsolete}} [[cattle|Cattle]].
